{"availability":"available","full":"YearningAsian/merge-desk","name":"merge-desk","description":"AI merges that wait for proof: conflict resolutions land only when both sides' intent survives and CI passes.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"TypeScript","stars":3,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-05T02:12:34Z","updated":"2026-10-08T16:15:58Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://merge-desk-swart.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://merge-desk-swart.vercel.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:42.248Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:42.248Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:42.248Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T23:43:42.248Z","stars":3,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Merge Desk shows a merge conflict as two intentions side by side (\"ours renames fetchUser\", \"theirs adds a retry on 429\"), asks Gemini to propose a resolution, and runs visible checks before anything lands. The result must parse, pass a deterministic check against the user's chosen option, and pass the selected test suite in a sandbox. A proposal that loses a required change or fails a check is held, with the reason shown. These checks report specific evidence; they do not prove semantic correctness."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/YearningAsian/merge-desk/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"787459c57b7b1dea8a7f14741b494642b13036961d30e3be2f580e3f84275608","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:42.390Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:42.390Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Merge Desk shows a merge conflict as two intentions side by side (\"ours renames fetchUser\", \"theirs adds a retry on 429\"), asks Gemini to propose a resolution, and runs visible checks before anything lands. The result must parse, pass a deterministic check against the user's chosen option, and pass the selected test suite in a sandbox. A proposal that loses a required change or fails a check is held, with the reason shown. These checks report specific evidence; they do not prove semantic correctness.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/YearningAsian/merge-desk/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Live mode there is sign-in only, for the allowlisted account on this repository; /api/health reports the GitHub App, Gemini, the sandbox credential and the daily usage throttle as configured, and a probe checks it every 30 minutes.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/YearningAsian/merge-desk/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"No sign-in and no keys: the desk replays real work recorded on the three seeded demo pull requests (#1 verified, #2 held, #6 a chosen drop) at its original pace.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/YearningAsian/merge-desk/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"787459c57b7b1dea8a7f14741b494642b13036961d30e3be2f580e3f84275608","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/YearningAsian/merge-desk/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:42.390Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T16:15:58Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/YearningAsian/merge-desk/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:42.391Z","hash":"787459c57b7b1dea8a7f14741b494642b13036961d30e3be2f580e3f84275608","originalBytes":8661,"storedBytes":8661,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["run","npm","demo","merge","live","pull","real","checks","docs","github","held","runs","test","app","check","gate","candidate","desk","gemini","land","option","verified","every","never","recordings","request","sandbox","uses","base","local","main","mode","only","requests","reset","retry","account","actual","chosen","conflicts","decision","drop","each","judge","needs","own","record","recorded","repository","review","seeded","sign-in","snapshot","stack.md","tests","through","writes","branches","clean","code","configuration","configured","daily","devpo